<title>INDIA: India Mastek falls on FII holding limit.</title>
<headline>India Mastek falls on FII holding limit.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Indian software firm Mastek Ltd. tumbled 13.50 rupees, or 6.5 percent, to 195.0 at the Bombay exchange on Monday after the central bank barred foreign institutional investors (FII) from making fresh purchases in the stock, dealers said.</p>
</text>
